<title>UK: Bremer unit sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>Bremer unit sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Bruxelles Lambert and Banque International a Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BREMER LB CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BREMER LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    16.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.92    PAY DATE  S-16.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 YIELD	 5.11 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/IBCA AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10-50     GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
